{"version":1,"content":"<p>商台廣播劇《十八樓C座》自1968年首播至今播出逾半世紀，承載幾代香港人的集體回憶，近日卻迎來重大角色變動。</p><p>劇中聲演灣仔「周記茶餐廳」後欄洗碗王后「祥嫂」的資深播音前輩朱雪梅，於今日（21日）正式宣布退休，告別陪伴無數街坊歲月的大氣電波。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T08:59:27.438705+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T08:13:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T12:17:52.963822+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T08:57:40.887470+00:00","content_hash":"51caaa37eb6ee525b1ad7c9dd4ec69795d8fc0d66c906c1a51e315a584e8461c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}